  "title": "Manzanita 2019",
  "indexDescription": "Manzanta Beach Vacation 2019",
  "description": "Manzanita beach vacation 2019.  \n\nTom and I made some nice sandcastles this trip.  It was fun to build them near the water and have the waves reach the them when we finished.\n\nThe house was pleasant and comfortable. \n\nThese are my iPhone photos of the Manzanita beach trip.  The previous collections Manzanita Evening and Jaclyn Pole Climb were taken with my SLR.  It was a slow transition from using my SLR all the time to only using my iPhone.  For a few years I would use both.  My iPhone was my wide angle lens.  Eventually the iPhone camera got so good and convenient and Live photos came out that I gradually stopping using my SLR.",
